    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakabikila Bena Isalele bonso, wakabambila ne, Unvuai, Isalele, mei ne mikenji bindi nnuambila mu matshu enu lelu, bua nuenu nubimanye ne nubienze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wetu, wakahunga nʼetu tshihungidi mu Holeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa kakahunga tshihungidi etshi ne batatu betu, kadi wakatshihunga anu nʼetu buonso buetu badi ne muoyo lelu eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakasomba nʼenu mpala ha mpala ha mukuna munkatshi mua kahia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Meme nakimana hankatshi henu ne Yehowa tshikondo atshi, bua kunulesha dî dia Yehowa; nuenu nuakatshina bualu bua kahia, kanuakabanda ku mukuna;) yeye wakamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme ndi Yehowa, Nzambi wenu, wakanuhatula mu buloba bua Ejipitu ne mu nsubu wa lukanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuikadi ne nzambi mikuabo ne meme hohamue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudisongidi luhingu anyi tshifuanyikishi tshia tshintu tshia mu diulu anyi tshia tshintu tshia hanshi ha buloba anyi tshia tshintu tshia mu mai adi muinshi mua buloba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kubmamina, kubitendeledi; bua meme Yehowa, Nzambi webe, ndi bianyi Nzambi wa mukau; ntu ngatumina bana ba tshihungu tshisatu anyi tshinai badi nʼanyi lukuna mibi ya batatuʼabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntu ngalesha bihungu tshinunu badi bansue ne badi benza mikenji yanyi luse lujalame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutedi dina dia Yehowa, Nzambi webe, tshitelatela, bua Yehowa kena ubingisha muntu udi utela dina diandi tshitelatela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvuluke dituku dia Lumingu, udijidile, bu muakanuambila Yehowa, Nzambi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukuate mudimu webe matuku asambombo, wenza midimu yebe yonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi dituku dia muanda mutekete didi Lumingu lua Yehowa, Nzambi webe: dituku adi kuenji mudimu, nansha wewe nansha muanʼebe mulume nansha muanʼebe mukashi, nansha muhika webe mulume nansha muhika webe mukashi, nansha ngombe webe, nansha mpunda webe, nansha bimuna biebe, nansha muenyi udi ku mbelu kuebe; bualu bua muhika webe mulume ne muhika webe mukashi nebikishe bu wewe mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvuluke ne wewe wakadi muhika mu buloba bua Ejipitu, ne Yehowa, Nzambi webe, wakakuhatulamu ne tshianza tshia bukole ne diboko diandi diolola: nunku Yehowa, Nzambi webe, wakalelela mukenji bua wewe uvuluke dituku dia Lumingu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
